                    <div class="fl-module fl-module-fl-woo-product-description fl-node-o4rx9j3wn7qa" data-node="o4rx9j3wn7qa">
                        <div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
                            <div class="woocommerce-product-details__short-description">
                                <h2 class="product-h3"><span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_lblH3">AFC Cardiology and Oncology Reading Workstation Desk: Elevate Your Monitoring Experience</span></h2>
                                <p>Discover the perfect solution for cardiology professionals with AFC’s Cardiology Reading Desk featuring an electric monitor lift. This innovative reading desk from the medical furniture manufacturing industry is specifically designed to enhance your cardiology workflow. The electric monitor lift allows you to easily adjust the height and position of your monitor, providing optimal viewing angles and reducing strain on your neck and eyes. AFC, a trusted brand in the medical furniture industry, delivers top-quality products that meet the unique needs of healthcare professionals. Upgrade your cardiology workspace with AFC’s Cardiology Reading Desk and Electric Monitor Lift for improved comfort and efficiency. Shop now and experience the difference AFC can make in your medical practice.</p>
                                <p>This Cardiology Reading Desk and Electric Monitor Lift is top-of-the-line technical furniture, exceeding standards in providing optimum comfort to serve the needs of medical cardiology healthcare professionals.</p>
                                <p>With a push of a button, this Imaging Center Desk for imaging center can be set to either a sitting or standing position. The monitor mounts are also independently height-adjustable with articulating monitor arms to give the best monitor viewing angle.</p>
                                <p>Standing position is recommended to professionals as it reduces most issues concerning prolonged sitting, thus enhancing productivity and maintaining good health. This adjustable sit-stand desk for imaging centers provides the most suitable adjustments to meet the preferences of individual users.</p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Electronic adjustment of work surface height.</li>
                                    <li>Electronically height adjustable monitor platform on telescopic drives with four Z-series monitor arms sliding on 54-inch track.</li>
                                    <li>Adjustable phone arm.</li>
                                    <li>Pop-up data port and USB hub.</li>
                                    <li>Ambi-Task, Red and White Light Combo.</li>
                                    <li>LED task light.</li>
                                    <li>Clamp-mount metal cup holder.</li>
                                    <li>Wire management for a clear area.</li>
                                    <li>Five, 4 inch casters (two of them locking).</li>
                                    <li>Height: 28″ to 47″</li>
                                    <li>Width: 72″</li>
                                    <li>Depth: 34 “</li>
